--- !u!1001 &561446390
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 2050974037}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 240428768818122195, guid: 7528917a249018c40ab4335ccecb7420, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4382241809103320246, guid: 7528917a249018c40ab4335ccecb7420, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Step into a world where every floor is a new challenge and every victory
        pushes you deeper into the unknown. In Everlasting Dungeons, your goal is
        simple: descend through as many dungeon floors as possible\u2026 but surviving
        is another story.\n\nAs you progress, the dungeons become increasingly dangerous.
        Face stronger enemies, discover new mobs, uncover powerful items, and explore
        content that grows with every floor you conquer.\n\nLoot matters.\nItems
        come with randomized stats, creating endless possibilities for builds. Chase
        perfect rolls, experiment with different setups, and forge your own path
        to power.\n\nRebirth to grow stronger.\nWhen progress slows, choose to Rebirth
        \u2014 sacrificing almost everything you\u2019ve earned in exchange for permanent
        strength boosts and greater potential for future runs.\n\nClimb the leaderboards.\nCompete
        against other adventurers, push farther than anyone else, and fight for your
        place among the strongest players in the game.\n\nThe dungeon never ends.\nThe
        challenge never stops.\nHow deep can you go?\n\nEnter the dungeon. Defy the
        impossible. Become legendary."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4382241809103320246, guid: 7528917a249018c40ab4335ccecb7420, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 32.55
